# Welcome to the Rogallo Documentation!

This is a sample of some Gemtext, served by a Spartan server.

## Places to go from here

There are many places you can go from here, if you want to explore Spartanspace. You could drop in on Dave's little server:

=> spartan://tilde.team/~davep/

Or you could read all about the Spartan Protocol:

=> gemini://spartan.mozz.us/

Spartan also has support for a special input line type, like this:

=: ./ Leave a comment!
